title: Dell PowerVault ME5: Enclosures
agents: dell_powervault_me5
catalog: hw/storagehw/dell
license: GPLv2
distribution: Sher Zaman
description:
 Monitors each enclosure of a Dell PowerVault ME5 system: enclosure health and
 status, and power draw. The model, vendor, midplane type, disk and slot counts,
 power supply and cooling element counts and the enclosure WWN are shown in the
 service details.

 Power draw is graphed, and optional upper levels on it are available. State is
 taken from the enclosure health value reported by the array, and the array's
 health reason and recommended action appear in the details when health is not
 OK. Conditions are configurable via the "Dell PowerVault ME5 enclosure"
 ruleset.

item:
 The enclosure id (for example {"0"}).

discovery:
 One service is created per enclosure, so arrays with expansion enclosures get
 one service each.
